//は不可能であった。
  He has assumed once more the high jodan. I see no evidence that his wound affects him.

  It must, surely... but to what degree, I can no longer hope to guess. Assuming anything where this man is concerned will get me killed. I know that now.

//　この男に対して、安直な予断は命取りだ。
//　今、まさに身をもって思い知った。

